{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18310080","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18310080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1831008001:1":{"text":"지난번 <style=\"highlight\">초승달</style>이 떴을 때 지나가면서 봤는데, 물이 피처럼 새빨갰거든. 그런데 오늘은 그렇게 붉지 않아.","source_cn":"上次<style=highlight>新月</styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8C4BCCB7B2667C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1831008002:1":{"text":"진짜? 나 속이는 거 아니고?","source_cn":"真的假的？你骗我的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C65924173679C18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1831008003:1":{"text":"속이면 내가 개다. 못 믿겠으면 다음 초승달이 뜨면 다시 와서 봐.","source_cn":"骗你我是小狗。不信你等下次新月时再来看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x715485D8A7D732D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1831008004:1":{"text":"진짜 빨갛게 변하면 안에 손 넣어 볼 수 있어?","source_cn":"要是真红了，你敢不敢伸手进去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0C41DBC7C9F37FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1831008005:1":{"text":"...너랑 그런 내기 안 할 거거든!","source_cn":"……我才不和你打赌呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B8350C6970AC6FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_femal